        "text": {
          "Text": "Two gradients make a sky. The Linear Gradient runs from its Start Color at the bottom to its End Color at the top; the Radial Gradient is the sun, a warm Center Color fading out to the sky, which is cabled into its Edge Color. The Master Gear's Ping-pong raises the sun and sets it. Try the Radial's Radius, and both gradients' colors."
        }
